    {
      "text": "the Lord’s word shall not pass away, D&C 1:38 (56:11). heaven and earth shall pass away, D&C 29:23, 26 (43:32; 45:22; 56:11). all old things shall pass away, D&C 29:24 (63:49). Saints to possess earth in eternity, no more to pass away, D&C 38:20. this generation of Jews shall not pass away until desolation comes, D&C 45:21. this generation shall not all pass away until house shall be built unto the Lord, D&C 84:5. destroying angel shall pass by those who observe Word of Wisdom, D&C 89:21. the Lord’s scourge shall pass over by night and by day, D&C 97:23. bounds of oppressors are set, they cannot pass, D&C 122:9. angels and gods are appointed by whom men must pass, D&C 132:18–19.",
